#: src/Modules/Newsletter/Admin/NewslettersPage.php:248
msgid ""
"DISABLE_WP_CRON is set and nothing has triggered the tick yet. You need an "
"external trigger (system cron or a service hitting wp-cron.php)."
msgstr ""
